WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:04.879
It's delicious!

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:07.173
They are treats from the landlords.

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:10.051
I got them as a thank you gift
for watching their place.

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:12.429
I've never had anything this delicious!

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.472
Thank you, Kotaro!

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.808
These are thanks for the daifuku earlier.

00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:19.352
Sorry to keep you waiting.
This is green tea.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:24.441
Warm green tea is the best
with Japanese sweets.

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:28.903
Yeah! It enhances the sweetness, right?

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:35.076
So, why are you in my room, Sir Karino?
I didn't invite you.

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:36.494
That's right!

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:40.540
Well, I take care of you quite a bit,
so why can't I stay?

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:43.835
I did not ask you to take care of me.

00:00:45.086 --> 00:00:48.131
But just the two of us
can't eat all of this.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.300
Maybe it's fine to have Karino sometimes?

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.843
Right?

00:00:51.968 --> 00:00:54.429
I'll bring some to Sir Tamaru later too.

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:55.805
Oh, that's good.

00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:58.391
Mr. Tamaru might cry tears of joy.

00:00:58.475 --> 00:00:59.851
That's true.

00:01:00.685 --> 00:01:02.520
-Where are your manners?
-Oh.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:05.648
Manga artists need to keep up
with current news, you know.

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:09.277
MIZUKI RE: I WAS WRONG
MEET WITH ME. I WANT TO TALK.

00:01:11.821 --> 00:01:12.989
DELETE MESSAGE?

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:14.824
This anime has finally become a movie!

00:01:14.866 --> 00:01:16.701
Tonosaman The Movie!

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:18.536
The Return of Tonosaman!

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:21.539
Do not go to the Terakoya
without breakfast!

00:01:22.123 --> 00:01:25.043
You must do your homework!

00:01:25.126 --> 00:01:28.379
Children should run around energetically!

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:31.674
Help me, Tonosaman!

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.602
We've kept you waiting!

00:01:42.727 --> 00:01:46.731
Tonosaman The Movie!
The Return of Tonosaman!

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:53.905
You can collect Tonosaman cards
at theaters!

00:01:54.405 --> 00:01:55.281
Tonosaman!

00:01:56.032 --> 00:01:58.284
They're making this into a movie?

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:00.203
Amazing!

00:02:01.412 --> 00:02:03.581
Kotaro, you like it that much?

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:07.544
Yes! Since I strive
to become like Tonosaman.

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:09.462
I want to emulate

00:02:09.546 --> 00:02:13.133
that unyielding iron will
and unbeatable strong heart.

00:02:13.216 --> 00:02:16.136
I need to become strong like Tonosaman!

